// endpoint_close_feed_image.proto — CloseFeedImage: close the image open over
// the workspace's feed. FEED section.
//
// The webapp closes the overlay when the reader clicks it or presses Escape.
// The daemon sets the workspace's overlay (frontend.v1.FeedImageOverlay) to
// its closed arm and pushes it on the root feed's watch. Closing an overlay
